            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "To shake? (हिलाना, hilānā.) To pull? (खींचना, khī̃cnā.) To push? (धकेलना, dhakelnā.) To throw? (फेंकना, phẽknā.) To taste? (चखना, cakhnā.) To smell? (सूँघना, sū̃ghnā.) To celebrate? (मनाना, manānā.) To grind? (पीसना, pīsnā.) To boil? (उबालना, ubālnā.) To fry? (तलना, talnā.) To weave? (बुनना, bunnā.) To hit? (मारना, mārnā.) To fight? (लड़ना, laṛnā.) To be afraid? (डरना, ḍarnā.) To shout? (चिल्लाना, cillānā.) To get tired? (थकना, thaknā.) To bear? (सहना, sahnā.) To remove? (हटाना, haṭānā.) To move aside? (हटना, haṭnā.) To pass by? (गुज़रना, guzarnā.)"
            }
          ]
        }
